timeline.message:
Switch to dis max for pinned queries

With `documents`, multiple queries can match the same document:

```json
[
  {
    "_index": "test1",
    "_id": "a"
  },
  {
    "_id": "a"
  }
]
```

Combining the scores with `should` is causing issues:

```json
{
  "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
  "reason": "boost must be a positive float, got Infinity"
}
```

This switches to dis max to use the highest score instead.

